      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village’s name traces back to a 1795 French dreamer, Pierre de Labigarre, who envisioned a grand settlement rivaling European cities.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
