      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tivoli%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Colonel David Schuyler’s 1688 purchase of Tivoli land from Native Americans is the earliest documented transaction, though records are lost.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
